================================================================================
AGPL-3.0 ARCHITECTURAL ISOLATION NOTICE: OpenMontage Adapter
================================================================================

This repository includes an optional adapter for OpenMontage (GNU AGPL-3.0).
Our integration is strictly isolated to prevent any license entanglement:

1. Process-level boundary: OpenMontage is invoked solely as an external,
   independent subprocess via system execution, exchanging only standard CLI
   arguments and consuming only its output media file.
2. No vendoring: No OpenMontage source code, modules, or binary artifacts are
   vendored, included, modified, or distributed in this repository.
3. Best-effort and non-dependent: OpenMontage is strictly optional and best-effort.
   The core pipeline never requires or depends on OpenMontage; rendering always
   reliably degrades along the video backend chain to guaranteed local FFmpeg.
4. Clean architectural boundary: The adapter boundary is strictly confined to
   src/cwt/video/openmontage.py and communicates through standard file paths only.
